      "premise": "In a world choked by thick clouds and stained with soot, my days are spent scavenging for scrap. One day, tucked away in a corner of the ruins, I discover a map to an unknown bookstore and a clue leading to the 'Ice Castle'—a place where the records of a lost civilization are said to slumber. With only a trickle of fuel left, a rusted prosthetic arm, and a worn-out steam gun, I set out on a journey to find the frozen memories of brass."
